                    {
                        "form_id": "01e3d00f-6c65-47d1-8688-a3e7e5b76f01",
                        "entry_id": "3855ccd7-3c41-3e78-bfbe-d9893a8d5586",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Ästheten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                        "entry_id": "3855ccd7-3c41-3e78-bfbe-d9893a8d5586",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die auf schöne und schöngeistige Dinge besonderen Wert legt und besonders darauf anspricht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d32b28a-9118-4ae9-bcdd-b3fce6ea31a6",
                                "sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                                "text": "„Zu den tonangebenden Ästheten zählte der Dichter Oscar Wilde.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2519bd30-f7d1-461b-90c2-9909c108bb03",
                                "sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                                "text": "„Er ist auf seine Weise auch ein Ästhet, er bringt es fertig, den Toast morgens dreimal, viermal in die Küche zurückzuschicken, bis Anna genau die richtige Bräunungsstufe herausbringt, ein stiller Kampf, der jeden Morgen neu beginnt, denn Anna hält Toast sowieso für ›angelsächsischen Blödsinn‹.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a405561-a073-4bf9-930d-1989d4c61585",
                                "sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                                "text": "„Für das Empfinden bürgerlicher Ästheten hatte der Dichter zugunsten des Agitators abgedankt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bcd67583-7bba-475b-97d6-ea791d3490cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "3855ccd7-3c41-3e78-bfbe-d9893a8d5586",
                        "source_sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die auf schöne und schöngeistige Dinge besonderen Wert legt und besonders darauf anspricht",
                        "target_lang_word": "aesthete",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aesthete",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "caa1578b-dc38-3348-a422-26a70aef79b6",
                                        "entry_id": "de32d128-f284-3a63-aab5-c2ec9edae5f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who cultivates an unusually high sensitivity to beauty, as in art or nature, often in a manner perceived to prioritize beauty over other qualities such as virtue and utility."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b06412aa-2bda-45d8-b6c1-fddc9b2601ea",
                                                "sense_id": "caa1578b-dc38-3348-a422-26a70aef79b6",
                                                "text": "I prefer to think of [literature] as providing a discipline of the sensibility—a special way of apprehending reality. But though I prefer such a conception, it gives rise to all sorts of misunderstandings […] To define literature in this fashion is to risk being called a mere aesthete and even an ecapist who refuses to face the harsh facts of life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5485689-2e16-4817-9f24-2b404b82c94a",
                                                "sense_id": "caa1578b-dc38-3348-a422-26a70aef79b6",
                                                "text": "Because what the aesthete does is to say, “oh, I can transform any unpleasant experience into a moment of beauty.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47bed246-cb55-4d6f-abbd-33c8900d9aa7",
                                                "sense_id": "caa1578b-dc38-3348-a422-26a70aef79b6",
                                                "text": "Although Stanley was the political operator while Pick was the aesthete, it was Stanley who made the early running in Underground design."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d87a8cab-e7b2-4f8c-9250-6b2cbe2368d2",
                                                "sense_id": "caa1578b-dc38-3348-a422-26a70aef79b6",
                                                "text": "Since the days of Søren Kierkegaard, aesthetics – by him termed the aesthetic that is worshipped by the aesthete – has been accused of subjectivism and relativism. An aesthete is allegedly characterized by finding sensuous pleasure in particular phenomena, and by being different from the ethicist or the religious person in being unable to recognize or commit himself to anything universal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ee91bd4-4c60-4cf7-8707-c4daa609b0d5",
                        "source_entry_id": "3855ccd7-3c41-3e78-bfbe-d9893a8d5586",
                        "source_sense_id": "4030468e-81c9-3e73-b9e3-e0456afb22d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die auf schöne und schöngeistige Dinge besonderen Wert legt und besonders darauf anspricht",
                        "target_lang_word": "esthète",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "esthète",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59ba01b5-486b-3820-800a-be827ec6fb17",
                                        "entry_id": "8738885c-690d-35dd-8129-477c5163235b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui, celle qui professe le culte du beau, qui aime la beauté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "note": "S'emploie parfois de manière péjorative",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5164e445-53c4-4099-8024-a1ec5facccdd",
                                                "sense_id": "59ba01b5-486b-3820-800a-be827ec6fb17",
                                                "text": "\"Tu es un esthète et un anarchiste, me dit Médéric, et je lui rétorque : \"Tu es un militaire et un prêtre\". Nous devons avoir raison tous les deux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25e91f6e-0bb6-4049-9543-80feac24ca33",
                                                "sense_id": "59ba01b5-486b-3820-800a-be827ec6fb17",
                                                "text": "Il avait deux raisons de mépriser la foule : d’abord comme aristocrate, ensuite comme esthète."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f11e260-85ea-425d-961f-5abfd151ce40",
                                                "sense_id": "59ba01b5-486b-3820-800a-be827ec6fb17",
                                                "text": "Ce fut une époque de beuveries à décarcasser un veau, parmi les vapeurs des pipes et les proclamations d’esthètes crasseux, toutes lavallières dehors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "637ba7cc-2913-40aa-85a8-7b6781c5aa4a",
                                                "sense_id": "59ba01b5-486b-3820-800a-be827ec6fb17",
                                                "text": "Il fallait voir, le jeudi 10 décembre 1896, tous ces pauvres petits bonhommes et toutes ces pauvres petites bonnes femmes, esthètes infortunés des deux sexes qui, l’œil noyé, tendaient le cou et ouvraient à demi la bouche pour communier en l'honneur d’Ubu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
